summary:
  The window opens at a remembered size the screen cannot show.

history:
  A config can be edited by hand and a screen swapped for a smaller one. A
  window taller than its screen has its lower edge, and the transport with
  it, where nobody can reach, so the remembered size stops at the screen.

target:
  package/contents/ui/WindowLogic.js

find:
      return Math.round(Math.min(most, Math.max(least, want)));

replace:
      return Math.round(Math.max(least, want));

expect:
  Killed by tests/qml/tst_windowlogic.qml::test_the_size_stops_at_what_the_face_needs_and_at_the_screen.
